        "original_id": "0cc7bc9a-55bf-5264-a933-3883115d0d8d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Martin Ruhe, Anton Corbijn, George Clooney, Ian Curtis, Thekla Reuten, Violante Placido, Irina Björklund, Paolo Bonacelli\n- Roles: cinematographer, director, singer\n- Films: Harry Brown, Control, The American\n- Topics: commercials, music videos, biopic, thriller\n\nFacts:\n- Martin Ruhe was born in 1970 and is a German cinematographer known for his work on the film \"Harry Brown\".\n- Martin Ruhe has mainly worked on commercials and music videos.\n- Martin Ruhe is also known for feature films including \"Control\" and \"The American\", which were both directed by Anton Corbijn.\n- \"Control\" is a biopic about Ian Curtis, the singer of Joy Division.\n- \"The American\" is a 2010 American thriller film directed by Anton Corbijn.\n- \"The American\" stars George Clooney, Thekla Reuten, Violante Placido, Irina Björklund, and Paolo Bonacelli.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
